<title>USA: Daniel valve sales, expenses to hurt Q1.</title>
<headline>Daniel valve sales, expenses to hurt Q1.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daniel Industries Inc said on Friday it expected its financial results for the first quarter to be hurt by a temporary decrease in sales of valve products and expenses related to the pending merger with Bettis Corp.</p>
</text>
